text: ['({T}: Add {G} or {U}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\nWhenever an artifact enters the battlefield under your control, untap Steelfin Whale.', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\n{1}, Sacrifice an artifact: Slag Strider deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Affinity for artifacts\\nFlying\\nWhen Thought Monitor enters the battlefield, draw two cards.', "Affinity for tokens (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each token you control.)\\nWhenever a token enters the battlefield under your control, tap target nonland permanent an opponent controls. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", "Alchemist's Greeting deals 4 damage to target creature.\\nMadness {1}{R} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)", 'All Rats have fear.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a Rat: Create X 1/1 black Rat creature tokens, where X is the number of Rats you control.', 'As Etchings of the Chosen enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\nCreatures you control of the chosen type get +1/+1.\\n{1}, Sacrifice a creature of the chosen type: Target creature you control gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature or discard a card.\\nDestroy target creature or planeswalker.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\\nSearch your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a permanent.\\nExile target artifact, creature, or enchantment.', "As long as it's your turn, Skophos Reaver gets +2/+0.\\nMadness {1}{R} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)", "As long as you've drawn two or more cards this turn, Spinehorn Minotaur has double strike.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, if that player has no cards in hand, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.\\nMadness {1}{B} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)", 'At the beginning of your end step, choose one —\\n• You gain 1 life.\\n• Return target creature card with mana value 1 from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if Nether Spirit is the only creature card in your graveyard, you may return Nether Spirit to the battlefield.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control four or more creatures, transform Hanweir Militia Captain.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice a token. If you do, put an acorn counter on Chitterspitter.\\nSquirrels you control get +1/+1 for each acorn counter on Chitterspitter.\\n{G}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Squirrel creature token.', 'Battalion — Whenever Boros Elite and at least two other creatures attack, Boros Elite gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Bloodbraid Marauder can't block.\\nDelirium — This spell has cascade as long as there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard. (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)", "Bonded Construct can't attack alone.", 'Cascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom in a random order.)\\nRetrace (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a land card in addition to paying its other costs.)', 'Cascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)\\nSliver spells you cast have cascade.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)', "Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nChangeling Outcast can't block and can't be blocked.", 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nDeathtouch', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nReach\\nWhen Webweaver Changeling enters the battlefield, if there are three or more creature cards in your graveyard, you gain 5 life.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhen Graveshifter enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhen Irregular Cohort enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 colorless Shapeshifter creature token with changeling.', 'Changeling\\nWhen Faceless Agent enters the battlefield, seek a creature card of the most prevalent creature type in your library.', 'Choose creature or land. Reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all cards of the chosen type revealed this way into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Choose one —\\n• Counter target spell.\\n• Target player draws two cards.\\n• Gain control of target nonland permanent with mana value 1 or less.', 'Choose one —\\n• Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.\\n• Return up to two target creature cards with power 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Choose one —\\n• You gain 4 life.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Choose two —\\n• Target player creates two tapped 1/1 green Squirrel creature tokens.\\n• Counter target loyalty ability of a planeswalker.\\n• Exile target card from a graveyard.\\n• T